Package: nubo-archive
Architecture: all
Description: Nubo OS package archive configuration
 The apt source and signing key for packages published at os.nubosuite.tech.

Package: nubo-server-core
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, nubo-archive (= ${source:Version}), nubo-base (= ${source:Version}),
         openssh-server, ufw, chrony, apparmor
Conflicts: nubo-branding, snapd, landscape-common, lxd-installer, ubuntu-pro-client, ubuntu-advantage-tools
Replaces: nubo-server-base (<< 0.8.0~beta3)
Breaks: nubo-server-base (<< 0.8.0~beta3)
Description: Nubo OS Server core
 What every Nubo OS server has: the Nubo identity, SSH without root login,
 a firewall closed except SSH, time sync and kernel network hardening.

Package: nubo-server-base
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, nubo-server-core (= ${source:Version}), unattended-upgrades,
         fail2ban, needrestart, curl, ca-certificates, htop, less, vim-tiny
Description: Nubo OS Server
 The core plus automatic security updates, brute-force protection, and the
 everyday tools for running a server.

Package: nubo-edge
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, nubo-server-core (= ${source:Version}), unattended-upgrades
Description: Nubo OS Edge
 The smallest Nubo OS server: the core and automatic security updates, for
 Raspberry Pi, old hardware and appliances.

Package: nubo-podman
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, nubo-server-base (= ${source:Version}), podman, buildah, skopeo,
         uidmap, passt
Recommends: podman-compose
Description: Nubo OS container host
 Rootless containers with Podman, ready for compose files, with one command
 (nubo-podman-init) to start the Podman service for your user.

Package: nubo-incus
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, nubo-server-base (= ${source:Version}), incus,
         zfsutils-linux, bridge-utils
Recommends: qemu-system-x86 | qemu-system-arm
Description: Nubo OS virtualization host
 Containers and virtual machines with Incus, set up by one command
 (nubo-incus-init) with a bridge and a storage pool.

Package: nubo-base
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, nubo-archive (= ${source:Version})
Description: Nubo OS base configuration
 Network check, time servers and update settings that point to Nubo or to
 neutral services, and no crash reports, news or adverts sent to Canonical.
